            Adsorption Isotherm Studio
          </h1>
          <p style="color: #64748b; font-size: 0.95rem; margin-top: 0.25rem; margin-bottom: 0;">
            Simultaneous multi-model fitting: Langmuir (q<sub>max</sub>, K<sub>L</sub>, R<sub>L</sub>), Freundlich (K<sub>F</sub>, 1/n), Temkin (b<sub>T</sub>, A<sub>T</sub>), and Dubinin-Radushkevich (E in kJ/mol) with interactive SVG visualizer.
          </p>
        </div>
