        <div style="display: flex; gap: 0.5rem; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center;">
          <span style="font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 700; color: #64748b; text-transform: uppercase;">Load Benchmark Data:</span>
          <button type="button" class="preset-btn" data-preset="mb" style="background: #f1f5f9; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0.35rem 0.65rem; font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; color: #0284c7;">Methylene Blue / Biochar</button>
